  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only. Receipts/disbursements from Statement of Receipts, Disbursements and Changes in Fund Balances (p4), Total Governmental Funds column. Taxes 3,863,797 split into property 3,627,704, motor vehicle 185,633 and lodging 50,460 using the Statement of Activities general receipts (p2); they sum to the printed line. Beginning cash = beginning fund balance 4,553,945 (p4); ending 4,336,411. Other financing = Sale of surplus 52,965 (p4). Balance sheet uses Statement of Net Position - Cash Basis (p1); no liabilities. Detail: General Fund recorded from the budgetary comparison schedule (p10) rather than the General Fund combining statement (p5) to avoid double counting; its budget-basis actual receipts (4,537,830) differ from the statement because the budget schedule excludes the Inheritance Tax and Veterans Aid funds and classifies Local/Intergovernmental differently. Road Fund from p11 budget schedule (disbursements printed as one line). Non-major funds: Total Non-Major Funds column of combining statement (p9); 12+ fund columns so combined; the individual fund columns on pp6-9 not recorded. Read pages 1-11 of 11."
